what:
Correction to 00974 part (2), 00709: blaze-cargo's v2 reads the release (cli `--version`, toolchain::library::fetch's release URL) through the new `blaze_cargo::release` (crates/blaze-cargo/src/release.rs), which v1's `blaze_cargo::engine::set` also fills for now. With main.rs no longer running blaze_engine::main, nothing would set it and the first `blaze --version` or std fetch panics. So main.rs is:

fn main() -> std::process::ExitCode {
    blaze_cargo::release::set(blaze_cargo::release::Release { version: env!("BLAZE_VERSION"), line: env!("BLAZE_VERSION_LINE") });
    blaze_cargo::cli::main(std::env::args_os())
}

(BLAZE_VERSION and BLAZE_VERSION_LINE are what blaze-engine's build.rs already sets.)
